  "steps": [
    "Remove the whole peel from the orange, lemon and lime with a vegetable peeler.",
    "Put the peels, brown sugar, ginger, cinnamon stick, coriander, nutmeg and salt in a small to medium pot. Stir often over medium heat until the sugar starts to melt.",
    "Stir in the water and bring to a boil over medium-high heat, then turn the heat to low and simmer 8 minutes.",
    "Remove the cinnamon stick and simmer 7 minutes more.",
    "Turn off the heat and cool 15 minutes. Strain through a fine-mesh sieve into a jar.",
    "For each drink, pour about 1/4 cup syrup over ice, top with sparkling water and stir. Add a squeeze of lime and a few drops of caffeine or vanilla if you like."
  ],
  "tips": [
    "Keeps 7 to 10 days in the fridge, or freeze in 2 tbsp cubes.",
    "Cherry cola: add 10 frozen sweet cherries with the spices and skip the nutmeg.",
    "Leave out the coriander if it tastes soapy to you."
  ],
